<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Land Q3 turns to loss. [CORRECTED 05:36 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bangkok Land Q3 turns to loss. [CORRECTED 05:36 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the third quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	 0.09     vs  Profit   0.22</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss	55.74     vs  Profit 129.03</p>
<p>				   Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	0.05	vs  Profit   0.81</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss     28.88	vs  Profit 485.25</p>
<p>(Thai Stock Exchange corrects nine month net loss figure for 1996 from 80.88 to 28.88.)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Bangkok Land Plc, a property firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
